## 예제 4: Trait & Implementation

### 파일: `examples/rust/traits.rs`

```rust
// 🦀 Trait: 인터페이스 정의와 구현

trait Drawable {
    fn draw(&self);
    fn description(&self) -> String;
}

trait Resizable {
    fn scale(&mut self, factor: f64);
    fn area(&self) -> f64;
}

#[derive(Debug)]
struct Circle {
    radius: f64,
}

#[derive(Debug)]
struct Rectangle {
    width: f64,
    height: f64,
}

// Circle에 Drawable 구현
impl Drawable for Circle {
    fn draw(&self) {
        println!("🔴 원 (반지름: {})", self.radius);
    }

    fn description(&self) -> String {
        format!("Circle with radius {}", self.radius)
    }
}

// Circle에 Resizable 구현
impl Resizable for Circle {
    fn scale(&mut self, factor: f64) {
        self.radius *= factor;
    }

    fn area(&self) -> f64 {
        std::f64::consts::PI * self.radius * self.radius
    }
}

// Rectangle에 Drawable 구현
impl Drawable for Rectangle {
    fn draw(&self) {
        println!("▭ 직사각형 ({}x{})", self.width, self.height);
    }

    fn description(&self) -> String {
        format!("Rectangle {}x{}", self.width, self.height)
    }
}

// Rectangle에 Resizable 구현
impl Resizable for Rectangle {
    fn scale(&mut self, factor: f64) {
        self.width *= factor;
        self.height *= factor;
    }

    fn area(&self) -> f64 {
        self.width * self.height
    }
}

fn main() {
    println!("=== Trait & Implementation 시연 ===");

    let mut circle = Circle { radius: 5.0 };
    let mut rect = Rectangle { width: 4.0, height: 6.0 };

    // Drawable trait 사용
    circle.draw();
    rect.draw();

    // Resizable trait 사용
    println!("\n반지름 2배 확대:");
    circle.scale(2.0);
    circle.draw();
    println!("넓이: {:.2}", circle.area());

    println!("\n가로세로 1.5배 확대:");
    rect.scale(1.5);
    rect.draw();
    println!("넓이: {:.2}", rect.area());

    // Trait object (동적 디스패치)
    draw_shapes(vec![
        &circle as &dyn Drawable,
        &rect as &dyn Drawable,
    ]);
}

fn draw_shapes(shapes: Vec<&dyn Drawable>) {
    println!("\n=== 모든 도형 그리기 ===");
    for shape in shapes {
        shape.draw();
    }
}
```

### 핵심 개념
- **Trait**: 메서드 정의
- **Impl**: Trait 구현
- **Static Dispatch**: 컴파일 타임 결정
- **Dynamic Dispatch**: 런타임 결정 (dyn)

### 장점
✅ 인터페이스 기반 설계
✅ 코드 재사용성
✅ 타입 안전성 유지

